  "releaseNotes": "v0.3.2: Resolve handler message types from referenced assemblies (parameter-type inference + ConsoleForge.Core/Widgets metadata fallback) — handlers for framework msgs like KeyMsg and WindowResizeMsg no longer fail with CFG002.\n\n        v0.3.1: Retarget to Roslyn 4.4.0 so the generator loads on stable SDKs (was 5.3.0, which failed with CS9057 on any SDK older than .NET 10).\n\n        v.0.2.2: Small changes to EquatableArray class\n\n        v0.2.1: Initial release — [DispatchUpdate] and [Component] attribute support, source generator implementation plan.",
